# FPS-FIELD-BARN: the FIELD_Barn per-pass GPU/CPU table, measured the same way on every build (UE `stat gpu` /
# ProfileGPU: one repeatable run gives the frame's per-pass GPU times; no hand capture). Played by the lead on the
# dev Editor (before) and the int/fps Editor (after), default machine settings (no machine.json overrides).
# Two measurements of the same view, 300 frames of warm-up each: A = still air (the scene's one WindSource at
# Speed 0, edit mode), B = the scene's own wind (Speed 1500 cm/s) under Simulate, so foliage sways and the cloud
# layer drifts (the gameplay clock the sway reads is zero while editing - Graphic/InstanceWind.hpp:11-12).
# GRASS-VIS: between A and B the same still-air view is measured again with the PPV (8180000000000003) asking for
# GrassVisibilityBuffer (table A2, shot 1_static_vis), then the flag is put back so B is measured as before.
# GPU timestamps: `--gpu-profile` on the Проект line switches them on with per-pass scopes (Sandbox.hpp:289-290).
# [gpu] PASS when editor.log carries two "[Profiler] ---- per-pass breakdown" tables (one after 1_static, one
# after 2_wind) with the same rows - "GPU: Frame Total", "Clouds: ShadowMap", "Clouds: SkyOcclusion" (gpu ms /
# gpu self; VolumetricCloudRenderer.cpp:1056,1228), "Clouds: ShadowMapHero" (int/fps only: it is declared on
# task/FPS-GPU-WIN, absent on dev) and the MeshRenderer::* / "Mesh: *" CPU scopes (cpu ms) - comparable between
# the dev run and the int/fps run. Each table is written by `Когда profile-dump` right after its `frames 300`
# (Control::Op::ProfileDump -> ProfilerWindow::DumpProfilerToLog, the same writer a headless --shot ends with;
# averaged over Profiler AvgWindowSeconds = 0.5 s, inside the 300 warm frames).
Проект Projects/Desert/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/FIELD_Barn.desce --gpu-profile
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,170,2500
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.15,-0.03,-1
Дано set 8180000000000004 WindSourceData.Speed 0
Когда frames 300
Когда profile-dump
Тогда-вид 1_static FIELD_Barn at 1.7 m, still air: field, barn, trees and sky drawn, nothing black or missing; [Profiler] table A (GPU: Frame Total, Clouds: ShadowMap, Clouds: ShadowMapHero on int/fps, Clouds: SkyOcclusion, MeshRenderer::* / Mesh: *) follows in editor.log
Когда set 8180000000000003 PostProcessVolumeData.Settings.GrassVisibilityBuffer true
Когда frames 300
Когда profile-dump
Тогда-вид 1_static_vis the same still-air view with the PPV's GrassVisibilityBuffer on (GRASS-VIS): the frame matches 1_static - mean |diff| <= 2/255 (pixel diff, not thumbnails); editor.log 0 VUID, no "GrassVisibilityBuffer refused", no "no grass visibility buffer"; [Profiler] table A2 has "Grass: Visibility Raster" and "Grass: Visibility Resolve", and its "Deferred: GBuffer" + "Deferred: Masked Depth Prepass" gpu ms is below table A's
Когда set 8180000000000003 PostProcessVolumeData.Settings.GrassVisibilityBuffer false
Когда set 8180000000000004 WindSourceData.Speed 1500
Когда run Action Simulate
Когда frames 300
Когда profile-dump
Тогда-вид 2_wind the same view under Simulate with the scene's wind: the same field, grass and crowns bent along the wind, clouds moved; [Profiler] table B with the same rows as A follows in editor.log
